[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 36661.51, "timestamp": "10:11:01", "text": "。  我該選羅納多，還是選我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 36700.07, "timestamp": "10:11:40", "text": "該去嗎？我不知道。  一秒鐘。我家人都沒打電話給我。一秒鐘。趕快。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 36706.15, "timestamp": "10:11:46", "text": "好吧，行。呃，梅西，然後"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 36710.11, "timestamp": "10:11:50", "text": "[音樂] 好了，我"}]